SUMMARY:LYDIA PENSE & COLD BLOOD
DESCRIPTION:Dinner Show with LYDIA PENSE & COLD BLOOD\nKnown as the Queen of Bay Area Rhythm & Blues\, Lydia Pense has been delighting audiences with her unique brand of Funk and Blues for over 50years. With this latest release\, Lydia & Cold Blood have leaned heavily on The Blues. But don’t worry\, there is still plenty of their signature “East Bay Grease” on this collection.
