SUMMARY:EL CAJON
DESCRIPTION:EL CAJON  \nEL CAJON is an American Indie Rock band from San Francisco\, formed in 2016. Three parts California\, two parts South Africa and one part Texas\, the band members are RJ Holmberg (Guitar and Lead vocals)\, June Holmberg (Keys\, accordion and backing vocals)\, Michael Rennie (Violin and backing vocals)\, Martin Ledyard (Bass and backing vocals)\, Kyle Hermans (Drums\, percussion and backing vocals) and David Gilmour (Keyboards and Accordion)
