SUMMARY:"A LICENSE TO CHILL" Jimmy Buffett Tribute
DESCRIPTION:  “A LICENSE TO CHILL” (Jimmy Buffett tribute) \n“A License to Chill”\, the Bay area’s best party band was formed in 2015 and launched in 2016 to bring the music of Jimmy Buffett to local fans (parrotheads) and anyone who enjoys fun\, uplifting music with a party vibe. \nAll band members are experienced musicians and performers who share a common philosophy of giving all of our fans a safe place to let their hair down and enjoy the many fun rhythmic tunes written by Jimmy Buffett including: Margaritavilla\, Come Monday\, It’s 5’ o’clock Somewhere\, Cheeseburger in Paradise and dozens of others. His music is described as a unique mix of pop\, rock\, country and sometimes Salsa or Calypso.
